[size=4][b]Structure, assets, and reusable components[/b][/size]

[img]https://cdn.venworkscreations.com/NexusMods/Canvas/ComponentGallery/structure-assets-reusable-components.png[/img]

[table]
[tr]
[td][b]Tag[/b][/td]
[td][b]Syntax[/b][/td]
[td][b]Rendered result[/b][/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][code]section[/code][/td]
[td][code]<section class="demo-panel"><p>Section content</p></section>[/code][/td]
[td]SECTION CONTENT inside a bordered panel.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][code]img with SVG[/code][/td]
[td][code]<img class="demo-image" src="gallery-icon.svg" alt="Canvas gallery icon"></img>[/code][/td]
[td]The packaged Gallery SVG displayed as a white square.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][code]svg / path[/code][/td]
[td][code]<svg class="demo-svg" viewbox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M 1 1 L 15 15 L 1 15 Z" fill="#66ffff"></path></svg>[/code][/td]
[td]A cyan square rendered from the inline path.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][code]template / vw-use[/code][/td]
[td][code]<template id="sampletemplate"><p>Reusable content</p></template><vw-use template="#sampletemplate"></vw-use>[/code][/td]
[td]The template instance displays REUSABLE CONTENT.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][code]vw-include[/code][/td]
[td][code]<vw-include src="include-example.html"></vw-include>[/code][/td]
[td]The packaged include displays LOADED FROM INCLUDE-EXAMPLE.HTML.[/td]
[/tr]
[/table]

Keep all images, stylesheets, includes, and entry documents beneath Interface/VenworksCanvas/Consumers/[i]<your-namespace>[/i]/. Canvas rejects absolute paths, parent-directory traversal, and remote URLs.

[size=4][b]Position and stacking[/b][/size]

[img]https://cdn.venworkscreations.com/NexusMods/Canvas/ComponentGallery/position-and-stacking.png[/img]

[table]
[tr]
[td][b]Tag[/b][/td]
[td][b]Syntax[/b][/td]
[td][b]Rendered result[/b][/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][code]position / z-index[/code][/td]
[td][code]<div class="demo-position-stage"><div class="demo-position-back">Back layer</div><div class="demo-position-front">Front layer</div></div>[/code] with a relative stage and two absolutely positioned children using z-index: 1 and z-index: 2[/td]
[td]The cyan FRONT LAYER overlaps the blue BACK LAYER.[/td]
[/tr]
[/table]

The exact Gallery CSS is:

[code-css]
.demo-position-stage { position: relative; width: 420px; height: 110px; }
.demo-position-back { position: absolute; left: 20px; top: 20px; z-index: 1; }
.demo-position-front { position: absolute; left: 160px; top: 42px; z-index: 2; }
[/code-css]

[size=4][b]Canvas data layer[/b][/size]

[img]https://cdn.venworkscreations.com/NexusMods/Canvas/ComponentGallery/canvas-data-layer.png[/img]

[table]
[tr]
[td][b]Binding or component[/b][/td]
[td][b]Syntax[/b][/td]
[td][b]Captured result[/b][/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][code]data-vw-text[/code][/td]
[td][code]<p data-vw-text="sampletext"></p>[/code][/td]
[td]BOUND THROUGH CANVAS DATA[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][code]data-vw-format[/code][/td]
[td][code]<p data-vw-text="sampleformat" data-vw-format="Score: {value}"></p>[/code][/td]
[td]SCORE: 42[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][code]data-vw-template[/code][/td]
[td][code]<p data-vw-template="Score: {sampleformat:integer}"></p>[/code][/td]
[td]SCORE: 42[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][code]setData sample[/code][/td]
[td][code]<p data-vw-text="sampleupdates"></p>[/code][/td]
[td]MENU-LOCAL SAMPLE DATA[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][code]data-vw-visible[/code][/td]
[td][code]<div data-vw-visible="samplevisible">Visible when true</div>[/code][/td]
[td]VISIBLE WHEN TRUE because the sample value is true.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][code]vw-state[/code][/td]
[td][code]<vw-state when="samplevisible"><p>Active state</p></vw-state>[/code][/td]
[td]ACTIVE STATE because the sample value is true.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][code]Event vw-state[/code][/td]
[td][code]<vw-state name="pingstate" event="venworks.canvas.example.ping"><p>Ping event activated this state</p></vw-state>[/code][/td]
[td]PING EVENT ACTIVATED THIS STATE after the Gallery dispatches its sample event.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][code]vw-repeat[/code][/td]
[td][code]<vw-repeat items="sampleitems"><p>Repeated item</p></vw-repeat>[/code][/td]
[td]Three REPEATED ITEM rows for the three sample items.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][code]data-vw-for-each[/code][/td]
[td][code]<div data-vw-for-each="sampleitems" data-vw-text="item"></div>[/code][/td]
[td]ALPHA ITEM, BETA ITEM, and GAMMA ITEM.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][code]vw-meter[/code][/td]
[td][code]<vw-meter class="demo-meter" value="samplemeter"></vw-meter>[/code][/td]
[td]A meter filled to the sample value of 72.[/td]
[/tr]
[/table]

The consumer owns the values. It obtains the HTML bridge during lifecycle ready, keeps a complete view model, and calls setData(model) after an accepted change. Calling setData() rebuilds the document's bound state, so publish the full model rather than a one-field patch.

Object items used by data-vw-for-each expose their properties. Scalar items expose item. A missing array renders no rows. The current binding limit rejects a non-array value or an array containing more than 256 items.

